          { i: '🏺', t: '105 shapes, infinite lamps', p: 'Ogee bells, twisted stars, pumpkins, nautilus spirals, basket weaves — every profile is parametric, so height, radii, flutes and twists are yours to drag. Or draw your own silhouette and trace a photo outline.' },
          { i: '💡', t: 'The one-piece vase-mode trick', p: 'The bulb holder sits at the bottom, and the app calculates the solid bottom-layer count for YOUR ring height and layer height (e.g. 10 mm ÷ 0.2 mm = 50). Enable vase mode, set the number, print the whole lamp in one go.' },
          { i: '🖼️', t: 'Photos & names that glow', p: 'Lithophane mode embosses any photo into the wall so it appears when the lamp lights. Text mode wraps names and dates on a curved baseline — glowing, raised or engraved. Personalised gifts, ready in minutes.' },
          { i: '🧱', t: 'Watertight, guaranteed', p: 'Every STL, OBJ and 3MF export is a closed, consistently-oriented manifold. Orca, Cura, Prusa and Bambu open them with zero warnings — no Netfabb, no repair step, no failed prints from bad meshes.' },
          { i: '📐', t: 'Your printer, checked', p: 'Pick your printer (Ender, Prusa, Bambu & more, or custom L×W×H) and the build volume appears around your design. Outgrow the bed and the validator warns you with the exact failing dimension — before you waste filament.' },
          { i: '📄', t: 'A print guide per lamp', p: 'One click writes a professional PDF tailored to your exact design: mode, walls, computed bottom layers, materials and assembly. The illustrated user manual is included too.' },
        ].map((c, n) => (
          <div class={`gc-card reveal reveal-d${n % 3} group border border-bronze-600/25 rounded-xl p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-cream to-white hover:-translate-y-1.5 hover:shadow-xl hover:border-bronze-600/50 transition-all duration-300`}>
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-bronze-600/10 border border-bronze-600/25 flex items-center justify-center text-2xl group-hover:bg-bronze-600/20 group-hover:scale-110 transition-all duration-300">{c.i}</div>
            <h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-bronze-800 mt-4">{c.t}</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-ink-700/85 leading-relaxed">{c.p}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ===== INSIDE THE STUDIO (annotated UI) ===== -->
    <section class="mb-16">
      <div class="text-center reveal">
        <p class="text-xs tracking-widest text-bronze-600 mb-3">INSIDE THE STUDIO</p>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-bronze-800">Four steps. Every control explained.</h2>
